<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Jan unemployment rises to 8.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Jan unemployment rises to 8.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Sweden rose to 8.8 percent in January from 8.7 percent in December, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 Jan 97     Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 8.8	   8.7	  8.1</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 375,000     371,000    347,000</p>
<p>NOTE - A Reuters poll of economists showed the market had expected an unemployment rate of 8.8 percent in January.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
